## 📌 Project Overview
This project implements a **complete, secure, and containerized Industrial IoT telemetry pipeline**. It addresses a critical security flaw in standard IoT deployments (plaintext MQTT communication) and provides a fully functional end-to-end architecture: from secure data generation to real-time time-series storage and visualization.

---

## 🏗️ Architecture & Data Flow

```text
[ Python Sensor ] ──(MQTT / TLS 8883)──> [ Mosquitto Broker ]
                                                  │
                                          [ Python Bridge ]
                                                  │
                                         [ InfluxDB Database ]
                                                  │
                                         [ Grafana Dashboard ]
